### 1. Missing fields → 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email" }

### 2. Wrong password → 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff1@example.com", "password": "wrong" }

### 3. Me without login → 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me

### 4. Correct login → 200 + user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff1@example.com", "password": "Staff@123" }

### 5. Me after login → 200 + user (cookie sent automatically)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me

### 6. Logout → 204
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/logout

### ===== INQUIRIES =====

### A. List without login → 401
GET http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries

### B. Login as staff1
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff1@example.com", "password": "Staff@123" }

### C. List → only IDs 1 and 2 (NOT 3)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries

### D. Filter by status
GET http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries?status=NEW

### E. Search
GET http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries?search=refund

### F. Invalid status filter → 400
GET http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries?status=DONE

### G. Create with missing fields → 400 with details
POST http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerName": "", "contactEmail": "", "subject": "Hi" }

### H. Create valid → 201
POST http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Saman Kumara",
  "contactPhone": "0711234567",
  "subject": "Booking question",
  "description": "Can I change my booking date?"
}

### I. Same request again → 409 DUPLICATE_INQUIRY
POST http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Saman Kumara",
  "contactPhone": "0711234567",
  "subject": "Booking question",
  "description": "Can I change my booking date?"
}

### J. Invalid ID → 400
GET http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries/abc

### K. Non-existent ID → 404
GET http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries/9999

### L. staff2's inquiry (direct link bypass) → 404
GET http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries/3

### M. Invalid transition NEW → RESOLVED → 422
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "RESOLVED", "version": 1 }

### N. Valid transition NEW → IN_PROGRESS → 200 (version becomes 2)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "IN_PROGRESS", "version": 1 }

### O. Same old version again (stale tab) → 409 STALE_INQUIRY
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "RESOLVED", "version": 1 }

### P. Login as admin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "Admin@123" }

### Q. Admin sees inquiry 3 → 200
GET http://localhost:4000/api/inquiries/3